--
Marked FUTURE (not KNOWNBUG) to avoid the KNOWNBUG CI job timing out.
Fully symbolic remainderf verification. The integer significand
division creates a ~194K variable formula that MiniSat cannot solve
within a reasonable timeout. The implementation is correct for all
concrete test cases. The SMT FPA back-end (fp.rem) handles this
efficiently.
